pe":"text","name":"3.1 Tipos de conflicto organizacional","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":42,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Black","postscriptName":"Roboto-Black","fontSize":24,"charSpacing":0,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}]}},"id":"b94d9a6e-8890-4818-b2bf-8485daeb6a3d","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":186,"ty":1164.5},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Black","family":"Roboto","style":"Black","size":24},"textAttributes":{"lineHeight":30}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"positioned"},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":0,"from":0,"to":37,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"3.1 Tipos de conflicto organizacional"}},{"type":"group","name":"Grupo 1177787","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintLeft":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true}},"id":"cc4959eb-68b6-4a08-b656-d75efd130b95","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":9,"ty":498.5},"group":{"children":[{"type":"shape","name":"Línea 107","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_LINE"}},"id":"659f5a2b-6409-47f9-bd93-92f2b7a33733","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":177,"ty":697},"style":{"stroke":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":219,"g":218,"b":218}},"width":3}},"shape":{"type":"line","x1":0,"y1":0,"x2":137,"y2":0}},{"type":"shape","name":"Línea 108","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_LINE"}},"id":"034a5e37-f6a4-4f5e-8ca4-5b88ec235519","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":177,"ty":697},"style":{"stroke":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":203,"g":213,"b":255}},"width":3}},"shape":{"type":"line","x1":0,"y1":0,"x2":46,"y2":0}}]}}]}},{"type":"shape","name":"Rectángulo 468298","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_RECTANGLE","constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":496,"ty":1752}}},"id":"ec10c8ac-2464-4f2e-9185-402bbf46f1a8","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-3599,"ty":-9955},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":255,"g":245,"b":232}}},"stroke":{"type":"none","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":112,"g":112,"b":112}},"width":1,"align":"inside"}},"shape":{"type":"rect","x":0,"y":0,"width":917,"height":170,"r":[10,10,10,10]}},{"type":"text","name":"Far far away, behind","id":"37555495-b214-48b9-a336-bd7d72a0798f","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-3598,"ty":-9755},"meta":{"ux":{"hasCustomName":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":300,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":497,"ty":1952}}},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"filters":[{"type":"uxdesign#blur","global":true,"params":{"blurAmount":10,"brightnessAmount":0,"fillOpacity":1,"backgroundEffect":false},"visible":false}],"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":916},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":126,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":126,"to":254,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":254,"to":375,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":375,"to":505,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":505,"to":628,"x":0}],[{"y":135,"from":628,"to":682,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Los conflictos organizacionales pueden clasificarse según diferentes criterios; uno de los más relevantes para la gestión del talento humano es el que atiende a su naturaleza y al efecto que producen en la dinámica del equipo. Esta distinción permite al gestor identificar si un conflicto debe ser intervenido de inmediato o si, por el contrario, puede aprovecharse como una oportunidad para estimular la reflexión, el cambio y la mejora colectiva. Reconocer la naturaleza de un conflicto antes de actuar evita intervenciones innecesarias y favorece respuestas más precisas y efectivas. Según esta clasificación, los conflictos organizacionales se agrupan en dos grandes categorías:"}},{"type":"text","name":"Far far away, behind","id":"00e3cf83-41aa-4dc0-89fa-e50399765e04","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-3910,"ty":-9066},"meta":{"ux":{"hasCustomName":true,"constraintLeft":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":300,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":185,"ty":2641}}},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"filters":[{"type":"uxdesign#blur","global":true,"params":{"blurAmount":10,"brightnessAmount":0,"fillOpacity":1,"backgroundEffect":false},"visible":false}],"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":1228},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":159,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":159,"to":329,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":329,"to":438,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"La distinción entre conflictos funcionales y disfuncionales no siempre es evidente en el momento en que surge la tensión; un mismo desacuerdo puede derivar en cualquiera de los dos según la forma en que se aborde. Por ello, el papel del gestor de talento humano no consiste únicamente en eliminar el conflicto, sino en crear las condiciones para que derive en aprendizaje y mejora colectiva en lugar de deterioro y bloqueo organizacional."}},{"type":"text","name":"Far far away, behind","id":"dcfa54fb-e64a-4226-a777-d4a277b9b9fb","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-3806,"ty":-8120},"meta":{"ux":{"hasCustomName":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":300,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":289,"ty":3587}}},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"filters":[{"type":"uxdesign#blur","global":true,"params":{"blurAmount":10,"brightnessAmount":0,"fillOpacity":1,"backgroundEffect":false},"visible":false}],"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":707},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":89,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":89,"to":179,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":179,"to":271,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":271,"to":368,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":368,"to":463,"x":0}],[{"y":135,"from":463,"to":535,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Cada nivel de conflicto exige un tipo de intervención diferente: mientras los conflictos intrapersonales requieren acompañamiento individual y espacios de reflexión personal, los interpersonales demandan mediación y comunicación estructurada. Los de carácter intragrupal necesitan intervención sobre la dinámica interna del equipo, y los intergrupales exigen acuerdos que trasciendan los intereses particulares de cada área. Comprender en qué nivel se origina el conflicto es el punto de partida para una gestión pertinente y efectiva."}},{"type":"text","name":"Far far away, behind","id":"8a243daa-cfd7-4ace-8f19-b73aafaf3ce7","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-3450,"ty":-9927},"meta":{"ux":{"hasCustomName":true,"constraintWidth":true,"constraintRight":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":300,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":645,"ty":1780}}},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"filters":[{"type":"uxdesign#blur","global":true,"params":{"blurAmount":10,"brightnessAmount":0,"fillOpacity":1,"backgroundEffect":false},"visible":false}],"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":725},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":100,"x":0}],[{"y":39,"from":100,"to":196,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":196,"to":296,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":296,"to":395,"x":0}],[{"y":111,"from":395,"to":444,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"El conflicto organizacional puede definirse como la situación en la que dos o más personas o grupos perciben que sus intereses, necesidades o valores son incompatibles, lo que genera tensión y la necesidad de tomar decisiones sobre cómo actuar. Lejos de ser inherentemente negativo, el conflicto puede ser una oportunidad valiosa para cuestionar supuestos, generar nuevas ideas y fortalecer las relaciones cuando se gestiona de manera adecuada."}},{"type":"group","name":"Grupo 1201911","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintTop":true,"constraintHeight":true,"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":9,"ty":564}}},"id":"baf513a3-5fc9-4d79-